ive</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>פְּשֹׁ֫טָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 32:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,11)\">Isa 32:11</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> plural <bdbheb>פּשְׁטִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 4:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,17)\">Neh 4:17</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>strip off, put off</highlight>, one's garment (accusative) <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,24)\">1Sam 19:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,16)\">Ezek 26:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,4)\">Lev 6:4</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>לָבַשׁ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Lev 16:23\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,23)\">Lev 16:23</ref> (<highlight>id.</highlight>; both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Neh 4:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,17)\">Neh 4:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 5:3\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,3)\">Song 5:3</ref> accusative omitted <ref ref=\"Isa 32:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,11)\">Isa 32:11</ref> of locusts <ref ref=\"Nah 3:16\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,16)\">Nah 3:16</ref> <highlight>stripping off</highlight> (sheaths of wings, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Da')\">Da</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> Amos.85). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>put off</highlight> (one's shelter), i.e. <highlight>make a dash</highlight> (from a sheltered place), with <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:37\" b